sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Runtime calls during enrollment
    accDescr: The API calls the service, which reads data through its injected store, calls the domain rules, saves through the store, and returns a result. This shows the successful call sequence, not transaction or concurrency guarantees.
    participant A as API
    participant S as service
    participant D as domain
    participant R as DB adapter
    A->>S: ① Enroll
    S->>R: ② Load student and course
    R-->>S: Return data
    S->>D: ③ Apply rules
    D-->>S: Business result
    S->>R: ④ Save enrollment
    R-->>S: Confirm save
    S-->>A: ⑤ Return result
